### ============================================
### FastMeals Optimization Service — REST Client
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3005
@adminToken = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN_ADMIN_AQUI

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Execute Optimization (admin only)
### ──────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/optimize-assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Viewer tries to optimize (403)
### ──────────────────────────────────

# Use viewer token here
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/optimize-assignment
Authorization: Bearer COLE_VIEWER_TOKEN_AQUI

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Without token (401)
### ──────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/optimize-assignment